{"seq":3,"slug":"clipboard-paste-detection","title":"剪贴板与粘贴检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/deferred/clipboard-paste-detection","wordCount":1233,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"剪贴板与粘贴检测\">剪贴板与粘贴检测</h1><p>剪贴板（Clipboard/Pasteboard）是延迟深链的另一种实现路径：在用户点击链接时将深链参数写入设备剪贴板，App 首次启动时读取剪贴板内容来恢复用户意图。这个方案不依赖指纹匹配，确定性更强，但面临严格的平台隐私限制，需要精心设计才能合规使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>剪贴板方案的优势</strong>：与指纹匹配相比，剪贴板传递是确定性的（同一台设备写入读出），不存在概率匹配的误归因风险，在同一 WiFi 下多设备场景也不会互相干扰</li>\n<li><strong>iOS 16 的破坏性变化</strong>：读取其他 App 写入的剪贴板需要用户在弹窗中确认&quot;允许粘贴&quot;，用户拒绝后延迟深链静默失败，这是剪贴板方案的主要局限</li>\n<li><strong>Android 10+ 的限制</strong>：App 处于后台时无法读取剪贴板，只有在前台或有焦点时才能访问，首次启动时处于前台因此通常不受影响</li>\n<li><strong>单次读取原则</strong>：成功读取后立即清空剪贴板并记录已处理标志，防止重复触发和被其他 App 读取</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"剪贴板方案的基本原理\">剪贴板方案的基本原理</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant User as 用户&#10;    participant Browser as Safari/Chrome&#10;    participant Clip as 系统剪贴板&#10;    participant App as App(首次启动)&#10;&#10;    User-&gt;&gt;Browser: 点击深链页面&#10;    Browser-&gt;&gt;Clip: 写入 Base64(深链参数)&#10;    Note over Browser: JS: navigator.clipboard.writeText() 或 document.execCommand(&#39;copy&#39;)&#10;    User-&gt;&gt;User: 安装 App&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;Clip: 读取剪贴板内容&#10;    Clip-&gt;&gt;App: 返回 Base64(深链参数)&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;App: 解析参数,导航目标页\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant Browser as Safari/Chrome\n    participant Clip as 系统剪贴板\n    participant App as App(首次启动)\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;Browser: 点击深链页面\n    Browser-&gt;&gt;Clip: 写入 Base64(深链参数)\n    Note over Browser: JS: navigator.clipboard.writeText() 或 document.execCommand('copy')\n    User-&gt;&gt;User: 安装 App\n    App-&gt;&gt;Clip: 读取剪贴板内容\n    Clip-&gt;&gt;App: 返回 Base64(深链参数)\n    App-&gt;&gt;App: 解析参数,导航目标页</pre><p>剪贴板中的内容通常是 Base64 编码的 JSON，包含深链 URL 和附加参数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"eyJsaW5rIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9leGFtcGxlLmNvbS9wcm9kdWN0LzEyMyIsInNvdXJjZSI6ImZhY2Vib29rIiwidHMiOjE3MjAwMDAwMDB9\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>eyJsaW5rIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9leGFtcGxlLmNvbS9wcm9kdWN0LzEyMyIsInNvdXJjZSI6ImZhY2Vib29rIiwidHMiOjE3MjAwMDAwMDB9</span></span></code></pre></div><p>解码后：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;link&quot;: &quot;https://example.com/product/123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;source&quot;: &quot;facebook&quot;,&#10;  &quot;ts&quot;: 1720000000&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"link\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://example.com/product/123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"facebook\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1720000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"ios-剪贴板的隐私演进\">iOS 剪贴板的隐私演进</h2><p>苹果对剪贴板访问的限制是历史上最显著的平台级变化之一：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>iOS 版本</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>开发者影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>iOS 13 及以前</td>\n<td>App 可静默读取剪贴板</td>\n<td>无限制，延迟深链可靠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iOS 14</td>\n<td>读取剪贴板时弹出 Toast 提示（&quot;App 粘贴了来自...的内容&quot;）</td>\n<td>用户感知，部分不适</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iOS 16</td>\n<td>提示变为确认对话框（&quot;是否允许粘贴&quot;）</td>\n<td>用户必须主动确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iOS 17+</td>\n<td>读取其他 App 内容的剪贴板需要用户明确授权</td>\n<td>延迟深链依赖用户操作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>iOS 16 的对话框是破坏性变化。用户如果拒绝&quot;粘贴&quot;，App 读取到的是 <code>nil</code>，延迟深链静默失败。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ios-的-uipasteboard-api\">iOS 的 UIPasteboard API</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"import UIKit&#10;&#10;class DeferredDeepLinkManager {&#10;&#10;    func checkClipboardForDeepLink() {&#10;        // iOS 16+ 需要先检查是否有内容，再触发读取&#10;        // 直接读取会触发权限提示&#10;        let pasteboard = UIPasteboard.general&#10;&#10;        // 检查是否可能含有我们的数据（避免不必要的权限请求）&#10;        guard pasteboard.hasStrings else { return }&#10;&#10;        // iOS 16+: 这里会触发&quot;是否允许粘贴&quot;对话框&#10;        guard let content = pasteboard.string else { return }&#10;&#10;        // 验证内容格式，避免误读用户真实剪贴板&#10;        guard let data = Data(base64Encoded: content),&#10;              let params = try? JSONDecoder().decode(DeepLinkParams.self, from: data),&#10;              isValidDeepLinkParams(params) else {&#10;            return&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        // 清空剪贴板（避免重复触发）&#10;        UIPasteboard.general.string = nil&#10;&#10;        handleDeferredDeepLink(params)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private func isValidDeepLinkParams(_ params: DeepLinkParams) -&gt; Bool {&#10;        // 检查时间戳，超过 5 分钟认为无效&#10;        let age = Date().timeIntervalSince1970 - params.timestamp&#10;        return age &lt; 300 &amp;&amp; params.link.hasPrefix(&quot;https://example.com&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UIKit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DeferredDeepLinkManager</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> checkClipboardForDeepLink</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // iOS 16+ 需要先检查是否有内容，再触发读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 直接读取会触发权限提示</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pasteboard </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> UIPasteboard.general</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 检查是否可能含有我们的数据（避免不必要的权限请求）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        guard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pasteboard.hasStrings </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // iOS 16+: 这里会触发\"是否允许粘贴\"对话框</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        guard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> content </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pasteboard.string </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 验证内容格式，避免误读用户真实剪贴板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        guard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">base64Encoded</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: content),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">              let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> params </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSONDecoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(DeepLinkParams.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: data),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">              isValidDeepLinkParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 清空剪贴板（避免重复触发）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        UIPasteboard.general.string </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        handleDeferredDeepLink</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isValidDeepLinkParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> params: DeepLinkParams) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 检查时间戳，超过 5 分钟认为无效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().timeIntervalSince1970 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> params.timestamp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 300</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> params.link.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hasPrefix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"app-tracking-transparency-的关联影响\">App Tracking Transparency 的关联影响</h3><p>ATT（AppTrackingTransparency）不直接限制剪贴板读取，但 iOS 14.5 之后整体的用户隐私意识和系统级提示的增加，使得剪贴板读取的用户接受度明显下降。</p>\n<p>如果 App 需要读取剪贴板，建议在 <code>NSUserTrackingUsageDescription</code>（Info.plist）中清晰说明用途，即使剪贴板读取本身不需要 ATT 授权。</p>\n<h2 id=\"android-剪贴板访问\">Android 剪贴板访问</h2><p>Android 的剪贴板策略与 iOS 不同，有版本分水岭：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Android 版本</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Android 9 及以前</td>\n<td>后台可读剪贴板</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Android 10+</td>\n<td>后台无法读取剪贴板</td>\n<td>仅前台或有焦点时可读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Android 13+</td>\n<td>读取时显示 Toast 提示</td>\n<td>不强制确认，但用户可感知</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"android-clipboardmanager-api\">Android ClipboardManager API</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class DeferredDeepLinkManager(private val context: Context) {&#10;&#10;    fun checkClipboardForDeepLink() {&#10;        val clipboard = context.getSystemService(Context.CLIPBOARD_SERVICE)&#10;                as ClipboardManager&#10;&#10;        // Android 10+ 仅在 App 有焦点时才能读取&#10;        if (!clipboard.hasPrimaryClip()) return&#10;&#10;        val clip = clipboard.primaryClip ?: return&#10;        if (clip.itemCount == 0) return&#10;&#10;        val text = clip.getItemAt(0).coerceToText(context).toString()&#10;&#10;        // 验证格式&#10;        val params = parseDeepLinkParams(text) ?: return&#10;&#10;        // 读取后清空（Android 10+ 清空自己写入的剪贴板）&#10;        clipboard.clearPrimaryClip()&#10;&#10;        handleDeferredDeepLink(params)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private fun parseDeepLinkParams(text: String): DeepLinkParams? {&#10;        return try {&#10;            val decoded = String(Base64.decode(text, Base64.DEFAULT))&#10;            val json = JSONObject(decoded)&#10;            val ts = json.getLong(&quot;ts&quot;)&#10;            // 超过 5 分钟无效&#10;            if (System.currentTimeMillis() / 1000 - ts &gt; 300) return null&#10;            DeepLinkParams(&#10;                link = json.getString(&quot;link&quot;),&#10;                source = json.optString(&quot;source&quot;),&#10;                timestamp = ts&#10;            )&#10;        } catch (e: Exception) {&#10;            null&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class DeferredDeepLinkManager(private val context: Context) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun checkClipboardForDeepLink() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val clipboard = context.getSystemService(Context.CLIPBOARD_SERVICE)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                as ClipboardManager</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // Android 10+ 仅在 App 有焦点时才能读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!clipboard.hasPrimaryClip()) return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val clip = clipboard.primaryClip ?: return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (clip.itemCount == 0) return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val text = clip.getItemAt(0).coerceToText(context).toString()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 验证格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val params = parseDeepLinkParams(text) ?: return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 读取后清空（Android 10+ 清空自己写入的剪贴板）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        clipboard.clearPrimaryClip()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        handleDeferredDeepLink(params)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private fun parseDeepLinkParams(text: String): DeepLinkParams? {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val decoded = String(Base64.decode(text, Base64.DEFAULT))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val json = JSONObject(decoded)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val ts = json.getLong(\"ts\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 超过 5 分钟无效</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (System.currentTimeMillis() / 1000 - ts > 300) return null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            DeepLinkParams(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                link = json.getString(\"link\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                source = json.optString(\"source\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                timestamp = ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } catch (e: Exception) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"隐私合规设计原则\">隐私合规设计原则</h2><p>使用剪贴板传递深链参数时，必须遵守以下原则：</p>\n<h3 id=\"最小数据原则\">最小数据原则</h3><p>剪贴板内容只包含必要的深链参数，不包含任何可识别个人身份的信息（PII）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// 合规：仅包含功能参数&#10;{&#10;  &quot;link&quot;: &quot;/product/123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;campaign&quot;: &quot;summer&quot;,&#10;  &quot;ts&quot;: 1720000000&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 不合规：包含用户标识&#10;{&#10;  &quot;link&quot;: &quot;/product/123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;user_id&quot;: &quot;12345678&quot;,&#10;  &quot;email&quot;: &quot;user@example.com&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 合规：仅包含功能参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"link\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/product/123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"campaign\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"summer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1720000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不合规：包含用户标识</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"link\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/product/123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"user_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"12345678\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user@example.com\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"时间戳过期验证\">时间戳过期验证</h3><p>必须检查时间戳，过期的剪贴板内容不得处理。推荐过期时间为 3–5 分钟：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"guard Date().timeIntervalSince1970 - params.timestamp &lt; 300 else {&#10;    return  // 超时，忽略&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">guard</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().timeIntervalSince1970 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> params.timestamp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 300</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 超时，忽略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"单次读取\">单次读取</h3><p>成功读取后立即清空，避免被其他 App 读取或重复触发：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"UIPasteboard.general.string = nil\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">UIPasteboard.general.string </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"内容格式签名\">内容格式签名</h3><p>为防止用户剪贴板中恰好有类似格式的内容被误解析，在 Base64 内容中加入 HMAC 签名：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;link&quot;: &quot;/product/123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;ts&quot;: 1720000000,&#10;  &quot;sig&quot;: &quot;sha256(secret_key + link + ts)&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"link\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/product/123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1720000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sig\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sha256(secret_key + link + ts)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"branch-sdk-的剪贴板实现\">Branch SDK 的剪贴板实现</h2><p>Branch SDK 在 iOS 16 之前会在首次启动时静默读取剪贴板，iOS 16+ 会弹出系统对话框。Branch 提供了 <code>checkPasteboardOnInstall</code> 配置项来控制是否启用此功能：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// Branch SDK 配置&#10;Branch.setCheckPasteboardOnInstall(true)  // iOS 默认关闭，需要显式开启&#10;&#10;// 监听读取结果&#10;Branch.getInstance().willShowPasteboardToast = {&#10;    // 即将弹出系统 Toast，可以在此时给用户提示&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Branch SDK 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Branch.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">setCheckPasteboardOnInstall</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// iOS 默认关闭，需要显式开启</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 监听读取结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Branch.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">getInstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().willShowPasteboardToast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 即将弹出系统 Toast，可以在此时给用户提示</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于 iOS 16+，推荐在用户主动操作时（如点击&quot;从链接继续&quot;按钮）触发剪贴板读取，而非在后台静默读取，以降低用户拒绝率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>剪贴板深链方案的核心设计原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>格式签名</strong>：Base64 内容中加入 HMAC 签名和时间戳，防止误解析用户真实剪贴板内容，签名密钥在服务端和 App 端保持一致</li>\n<li><strong>iOS 16+ 适配</strong>：不要依赖后台静默读取，改用用户主动触发的&quot;继续上次的位置&quot;UI 元素来引导粘贴授权</li>\n<li><strong>过期检查</strong>：5 分钟内的剪贴板内容才处理，超时视为用户旧有剪贴板内容而非深链参数</li>\n<li><strong>与指纹互补</strong>：剪贴板用于精确匹配（同设备），指纹用于跨设备意图保存（网页到 App 安装后），两种方案同时部署可覆盖更多场景</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>本章相关文档：</strong> <a href=\"deferred-deep-link-flow\">延迟深链流程</a> 介绍剪贴板以外的延迟深链整体方案；<a href=\"fingerprint-attribution\">指纹归因技术</a> 介绍无需剪贴板的概率匹配方案。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"剪贴板与粘贴检测","id":"剪贴板与粘贴检测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"剪贴板方案的基本原理","id":"剪贴板方案的基本原理"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS 剪贴板的隐私演进","id":"ios-剪贴板的隐私演进"},{"level":3,"text":"iOS 的 UIPasteboard API","id":"ios-的-uipasteboard-api"},{"level":3,"text":"App Tracking Transparency 的关联影响","id":"app-tracking-transparency-的关联影响"},{"level":2,"text":"Android 剪贴板访问","id":"android-剪贴板访问"},{"level":3,"text":"Android ClipboardManager API","id":"android-clipboardmanager-api"},{"level":2,"text":"隐私合规设计原则","id":"隐私合规设计原则"},{"level":3,"text":"最小数据原则","id":"最小数据原则"},{"level":3,"text":"时间戳过期验证","id":"时间戳过期验证"},{"level":3,"text":"单次读取","id":"单次读取"},{"level":3,"text":"内容格式签名","id":"内容格式签名"},{"level":2,"text":"Branch SDK 的剪贴板实现","id":"branch-sdk-的剪贴板实现"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"指纹归因技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/deferred/fingerprint-attribution"},"next":{"title":"iOS 深链实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/implementation/ios-deep-linking-implementation"}}